        "герц на кельвин"@ru,
        "Hertz Bölü Kelvin"@tr,
        "hertz bölü kelvin"@tr ;
    dct:description """
  $\\textit{Hertz per Kelvin}$ is a unit for 'Inverse Time Temperature' expressed as $Hz K^{-1}$.
