        qudt:Unit ;
    rdfs:label "Cubic Yard per Minute"@en ;
    dct:description """$\\textit{Cubic Yard per Minute}$ is an Imperial unit for 'Volume Per Unit Time' expressed as $yd^{3}/min$.
