        "千克每立方米"@zh ;
    dct:description "Kilogram per cubic metre is an SI derived unit of density, defined by mass in kilograms divided by volume in cubic metres. The official SI symbolic abbreviation is $kg \\cdot m^{-3}$, or equivalently either $kg/m^3$."^^qudt:LatexString ;
