    dct:description "$\\textit{Electric Field Strength}$ is the magnitude and direction of an electric field, expressed by the value of $E$, also referred to as $\\color{indigo} {\\textit{electric field intensity}}$ or simply the electric field."^^qudt:LatexString ;
